                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf58f0cf-4fec-320e-a33a-2b40b6b0d537",
                        "entry_id": "482b672a-b600-3cb6-b42c-a5d73197874e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wordsmith; one who uses language with cleverness and skill."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff0866fc-8e7a-40cd-b759-687b4eb319cd",
                                "sense_id": "bf58f0cf-4fec-320e-a33a-2b40b6b0d537",
                                "text": "Mr. Auslander is a logodaedalus — a wizard of words — whose adjectives possess an unerring salience, whose vigor is as undinted as he bronze of a Thracian shield."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39a62c2c-6107-41f4-a31f-a3905081e651",
                                "sense_id": "bf58f0cf-4fec-320e-a33a-2b40b6b0d537",
                                "text": "What had the ruffian café logodaedalus taught me?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b6a773d-06ff-41a3-acd9-685ed905d7f7",
                                "sense_id": "bf58f0cf-4fec-320e-a33a-2b40b6b0d537",
                                "text": "There are digressions on literature and the cinema and the tarot pack and crap-shooting and — above all, since Anthony Burgess has ever been a logodaedalus — language."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "270d9966-50a0-4071-aabd-58185a8d1db2",
                                "sense_id": "bf58f0cf-4fec-320e-a33a-2b40b6b0d537",
                                "text": "For example, Iain Gale of the Independent wrote of “the logodaedalus's universal sentence, 'The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog,\", which uses all the letters of the alphabet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a599713a-470a-4fd9-82a5-638e84744593",
                                "sense_id": "bf58f0cf-4fec-320e-a33a-2b40b6b0d537",
                                "text": "Yet this enterprise was a slippery one; fictitious etymologies and overclever wordplay were the province of the logodaedalus: a dangerously cunning wordsmith.."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
